WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.230
Jeremy Fisher was thinking about supper.

2
00:00:14.231 --> 00:00:20.846
"I'm sick of eating flies," he said.

3
00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:24.026
"I know!" Jeremy said.

4
00:00:24.027 --> 00:00:26.324
"I will go fishing.

5
00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:42.615
I will catch a minnow for supper!"

6
00:00:42.616 --> 00:00:48.328
Jeremy got his pail.

7
00:00:48.329 --> 00:01:00.089
He got his fishing rod.

8
00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:08.773
Then he went to the pond.

9
00:01:08.774 --> 00:01:12.512
The farmer was thinking about supper too.

10
00:01:12.513 --> 00:01:14.910
"I know!" he said.

11
00:01:14.911 --> 00:01:17.556
"I will go fishing.

12
00:01:17.557 --> 00:01:25.338
Then I can eat fish for supper."

13
00:01:25.339 --> 00:01:33.739
The farmer got his pail.

14
00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:40.009
He got his fishing rod.

15
00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:45.272
Then he went to the pond.

16
00:01:45.273 --> 00:01:51.318
Jeremy tossed his line into the water.

17
00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:55.792
He saw many ducks.

18
00:01:55.793 --> 00:02:02.886
He saw many flies.

19
00:02:02.887 --> 00:02:06.281
But no minnows swam by.

20
00:02:06.282 --> 00:02:10.039
Jeremy waited and waited . . .

21
00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:14.266
and waited.

22
00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.783
"Ugh," Jeremy said.

23
00:02:16.784 --> 00:02:21.755
"I'm getting very hungry."

24
00:02:21.756 --> 00:02:25.077
Suddenly something pulled on his line.

25
00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:28.007
"Yes!" Jeremy cried.

26
00:02:28.008 --> 00:02:32.175
"A fish for supper!"

